      "content": "The weight of your loss is immense, yet there is no honor in surrender when there is still a path forward. Focus on gathering what you can from the ashes, for every scrap saved could one day feed your children. Your spirit remains their shield, even if they cannot see you anymore. Wipe the tears away now, and take up the reins of your small fleet. Victory belongs to those who endure, not just those who win the first battle.",
